.TH FLAPBAT 1
.SH NAME
flapbat \- side-scrolling catch game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/flapbat
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I FlapBat
is a side-scrolling catch game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Flap to stay aloft and catch glowing bugs. A bar shows how many remain; clear the field for a session best time.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B space
Flap
.TP
.B Enter / r
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/flapbat.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
